        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/03442d23e40ba72dd1a364b506ca5575.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span><strong>A short story of about 50 minutes awaits you! I hope you enjoy it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't think of this project as something that will seriously scare you — it wasn’t intended to be a terrifying horror game, but rather more of an experiment or a fun little joke!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You receive a job from a dealer</strong> and learn that a group of archaeologists has discovered an ancient tomb in an abandoned mine near the city! Now you must get inside and <strong>steal the ancient artifacts</strong> to sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/cadc70ce26e6ee9893b05ac05e51a0c0.poster.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/cadc70ce26e6ee9893b05ac05e51a0c0.webm?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/cadc70ce26e6ee9893b05ac05e51a0c0.mp4?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will have to explore the forest surroundings and the tomb to find anything valuable. Since you are an experienced thief, you have an active skill called <strong>&quot;Thief’s Instinct.&quot;</strong> It highlights tracks and important items! <strong>Keep that in mind!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/03ac69830a7f5b89ffca73fe551628e5.poster.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/03ac69830a7f5b89ffca73fe551628e5.webm?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/03ac69830a7f5b89ffca73fe551628e5.mp4?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pretty Good graphics</strong> and <strong>surround sound</strong> completely immerse you in the eerie atmosphere of this mysterious place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.poster.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.webm?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.mp4?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Mara</strong></i> isn’t your typical first-person indie horror. You won’t find tons of loud jumpscares here. I wanted to create a small, interesting, dark, and sometimes funny story, so I focused more on the overall atmosphere rather than fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/03442d23e40ba72dd1a364b506ca5575.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span><strong>A short story of about 50 minutes awaits you! I hope you enjoy it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't think of this project as something that will seriously scare you — it wasn’t intended to be a terrifying horror game, but rather more of an experiment or a fun little joke!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You receive a job from a dealer</strong> and learn that a group of archaeologists has discovered an ancient tomb in an abandoned mine near the city! Now you must get inside and <strong>steal the ancient artifacts</strong> to sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/cadc70ce26e6ee9893b05ac05e51a0c0.poster.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/cadc70ce26e6ee9893b05ac05e51a0c0.webm?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr