op playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.poster.avif?t=1763717964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.webm?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/261bd95b9bdeb84d86dbe8a63c591ef0.mp4?t=1763717964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Mara</strong></i> isn’t your typical first-person indie horror. You won’t find tons of loud jumpscares here. I wanted to create a small, interesting, dark, and sometimes funny story, so I focused more on the overall atmosphere rather than fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/126bf5729b69b019e0ae48bd432b8925.webp?t=1763717964\" width=1560 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
